@startuml CU-01
actor "Usuario (Admin / Empleado / Cliente)" as Usr
boundary "«UI» Angular (login)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /auth" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» AuthService / user" as Model

Usr -> UI : Acceder a FASHIONSTORE
UI -> Ctrl : POST /auth/login (email, password)
Ctrl -> Model : authenticate(db, email, password)
Model --> Ctrl : usuario válido + roles
Ctrl -> Model : issue_token(user)
Model --> Ctrl : token JWT (claims + roles)
Ctrl --> UI : TokenResponse (access_token)
UI -> Ctrl : GET /users/me (Bearer)
Ctrl -> Model : get(current_user)
Model --> Ctrl : perfil + roles
Ctrl --> UI : UserRead
UI --> Usr : Sesión iniciada (panel según rol)

@enduml